  "releaseNotes": "0.14.0: Added WITH WHERE filtering for projected values and aggregate results. MATCH now executes every comma-separated pattern part, preserving shared-variable constraints and clause-level OPTIONAL MATCH fallback. Two-node patterns expand from an already-bound right endpoint instead of scanning the unbound left node, retaining labels and property constraints.\nFull changelog: https://github.com/JornWildt/Cyphoid/blob/master/CHANGES.md",
